    "narrative": "The **Gunnar Henderson** and **Luis Garc\u00eda Jr.** tandem anchors the Austin Waves lineup today, offering the highest projected efficiency among all starters. **Gunnar Henderson** (83.30) draws a prime matchup against Painter, where a significant boost from park factors and the pitcher\u2019s middling xERA outweighs the minor penalty for Painter\u2019s elite 1.86s catcher pop time. Similarly, **Luis Garc\u00eda Jr.** (74.11) benefits from a strong platoon advantage against Elder, whose skill profile remains vulnerable to a disciplined approach. **Vladimir Guerrero Jr.** (68.81) and **Jacob Wilson** (63.72) provide essential depth in the middle of the order; **Jacob Wilson** is particularly well-positioned, as favorable park dimensions help mitigate the challenge of facing Holton.\n\nThe optimization process for today\u2019s outfield proved tight, with **Sam Antonacci** (61.43) securing a start thanks to his leadoff positioning and a favorable matchup against Martinez. The decision to keep **Luis Robert Jr.** (52.06) on the bench was the most difficult, as he was only narrowly eclipsed by the structural advantages of our other outfielders. While **Luis Robert Jr.** remains a high-upside asset, his projected efficiency today was hampered by a negative platoon shift against Junk, leading to his exclusion in favor of higher-floor daily outputs from **Andy Pages** and **Jackson Merrill**.\n\nManaging the bottom of the order requires caution today, specifically regarding **Coby Mayo** (59.34) and **Liam Hicks** (59.93). Both occupy the \"Strong\" start tier, but their scores are dragged down by lower-order placement and, in **Coby Mayo**'s case, a regression hit from the catcher\u2019s defensive profile. While no immediate weather postponements threaten our slate, keep a close watch on **Liam Hicks** and **Sam Antonacci**; their projected utility is heavily tied to maintaining their respective leadoff spots. With SB scarcity remaining a primary concern, the presence of **Gunnar Henderson** and **Luis Garc\u00eda Jr.** at the top provides the necessary dynamic edge to attack our league\u2019s most volatile category.",
